          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{27}-\\sqrt{12}&=\\sqrt{9\\times3}-\\sqrt{4\\times3}\\\\\\sqrt{27}-\\sqrt{12}&=3\\sqrt{3}-2\\sqrt{3}\\\\\\sqrt{27}-\\sqrt{12}&=\\sqrt{3}\\end{align*}$$",
